# Release notes for CurseForge, Wago and the GitHub release.
#
# Without this the packager writes its own notes from the git log. Our commit
# messages are German by house rule and ASCII transliterated, so every release
# shipped notes that read like typos to anyone outside this repo, while the
# English changelog only ever reached Discord and the in-game patch notes.
#
# CHANGELOG-release.md holds the newest version's section only, and is written
# by tools/gen_changelog.js alongside Modules/ChangelogData.lua -- so the three
# places that show release notes all come from the same source.
#
# Careful: the packager falls back to the git log SILENTLY when the file is
# missing or stale, so a release that forgot to run the generator would quietly
# go back to German. tools/check.js compares it against CHANGELOG.md and fails
# the build before that can reach a distribution site.
#
manual-changelog:
    filename: CHANGELOG-release.md
    markup-type: markdown

# Build-time files that were shipping to players for no reason. Everything here
# is either never read by the client or only useful to whoever builds a release.
#
# CHANGELOG-release.md is NOT listed even though it is build output: it is
# unclear whether the packager still finds a manual changelog it was told to
# leave out, and a wrong guess there breaks releasing rather than just tidiness.
#
# Neither are the LICENSE / LICENSE.txt files under Media -- those document the
# terms of the bundled artwork and have to travel with it.
ignore:
    # Checker, generators, the distribution-site description, node manifests.
    # Nothing in either TOC loads from here.
    - tools
    # Notes to ourselves about a client we cannot test. Useful to whoever works
    # on the addon, noise in a player's folder.
    - docs
    # Sources, not assets: the client cannot render PNG. UI/MainFrame.lua asks
    # for TwitchV.tga and DiscordV.tga, which ship next to these.
    - Media/Icons/TwitchV.png
    - Media/Icons/DiscordV.png
    # A note to ourselves about where to drop a replacement minimap icon.
    - Media/README.txt
